SUMMARY:Author Talk: Vanessa Errecarte
DESCRIPTION:Vanessa Errecarte is an award-winning lecturer at the UC Davis Graduate School of Management and Founder and CEO of Marketing Simplified. She will discuss her new book\, Valuable & Visible\, with LeShelle May\, Senior Software Developer at CNN Internet Technology Group. \nThere will be special remarks by: \nH. Rao Unnava\, Dean\, UC Davis Business School \nJeanenne Ray\, Associate Publisher\, Trade Business and Personal Success at Wiley \nAdditional special guests will include several case studies from the book. \nAll tickets include appetizers and beverages. \nFor more information and to purchase tickets\, visit the Eventbrite page
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/author-talk-vanessa-errecarte/
LOCATION:El Macero Country Club\, 44571 Clubhouse Drive\, El Macero\, CA\, 95618\, United States
CATEGORIES:Books & Talks
